Z||000000||b lo 0||08-14-2001||01:33 AM||||I like to design hotrods, for those of you who don't know.  I just came up with my latest creation after watching Speedvision today.  Nash Metropolitan convertible-smoothed, but not to the point of nonrecognition.  Chevy 4.3 liter V6 from Chevy S-10 with a 700R4 trans, very narrowed 10-bolt rear with 10" tires, I'll post drafts soon. Feedback, plz!  I plan on starting my own shop after college.<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="1">'85 GT (in progress)<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.angelfire.com/ga3/audioimagery/ice.gif">       <BR>White Lightnin!  (NOT moonshine, for all you hillbillies!)</FONT><BR><A HREF="http://www.audioimagery.vstoreauto.com.com" TARGET=_blank>Audio Imagery</A>, budget-priced car audio supplies from people like Monster Cable, Sony & more!||||reg||1
