Z||000006||DaRkLoRD||08-14-2001||05:13 PM||||most of the cars I want are unique... but the street rod I want, is rather mundane compared to others..<P>1934 Buick sedan<BR>lowered, 15" chrome wheels (with spinners like the cobra had.. I like those)<BR>dark metallic purple paint<BR>tinted windows<BR>tan leather and oak interior<BR>old (repro) analog gauges, brass plated<BR>carb'd 305 with BIG chrome headers sticking out the sides, no side panels on the front..<BR>edelbrock intake<BR>wide open exhaust (yes.. loud...)<BR>and not a single pollution control device or piece of electronics in the car.. (no AC either.. just roll down the flat glass windows.. hehe)<BR>though I do plan on having modern disc brakes and suspension..<P>------------------<BR>     <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>     <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A><p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 08-14-2001).]||||reg||6
